    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42326" root="ولت" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَلَتَهُ حَقَهُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَلِتُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَلْتٌ</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اولتهُ</span></b> ;
<i>He diminished unto him his due,</i> or <i>right;</i> [or
<i>defrauded him of part thereof</i>]: (K:) as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاتَهُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَتَهُ</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلِتَهُ</span>. (TA.)

